00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:07.510
The first thing I want to discuss is whether
Luffy actually needs an awakening in the first

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:13.900
place. My short answer is yes, duh, the more
badass the better, but I'm aware that many

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:18.590
people actually don't feel that way. And I
guess you could fairly enough argue, that

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:23.750
Luffy didn't need to rely on his own awakening
to take down the likes of Doflamingo, Katakuri

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:39.290
or the guards in Impel down. Luffy now has
not only future sigh conqueror's haki, but

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:46.390
advanced armament and even advanced conqueror's
haki on top as well. Instead of relying only

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:52.470
on his fruit, he is combining it with Haki,
as no other character in the story has done.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:58.070
And in the end seeing him being creative with
