00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:04.190
But I think that if you argue like this, you
have probably misunderstood what Awakening

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:09.920
truly is. Awakening of a fruit doesn't mean
flipping a switch and automatically getting

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:15.500
a bunch of new powers. Minor Spoiler alert,
as Law and Kid's awakenings show us, it seems

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.489
to be much more of a process, that requires
a lot of energy and increasingly gives the

00:02:20.489 --> 00:02:25.620
user additional reach and effectivity on their
powers, allowing them to break the rules a

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:32.159
bit. But the main pre-requisite for awakening
is true mastery over one's devil fruit. Something,

00:02:32.159 --> 00:02:37.749
that only very few people are able to do.
And I think suggesting that Luffy hasn't or

00:02:37.749 --> 00:02:43.739
maybe never will truly master the gomu gomu
no mi, is something that I just can't ever

00:02:43.739 --> 00:02:56.650
see happening like ever ever. Ever ever ever.
Kaido might be the physically strongest enemy

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.159
he will have to face in battle, but I think
we all agree, that for the coming arcs, things

00:03:01.159 --> 00:03:07.410
won't get easier, but harder for Luffy. Facing
Akainu, Blackbeard and ultimately taking down

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:13.329
the World Government itself, all of it will
require Luffy to maximise his potential and

00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:19.019
I hope you agree that awakening his devil
fruit will be am essential part of that.

00:03:19.019 --> 00:03:25.670
So, how close is Luffy to reaching this level?
Are we talking Wano or Elbaf or Laugh Tale?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:31.779
I would say, let's look at all the factors
that should or could determine how much more

00:03:31.779 --> 00:03:39.159
Luffy needs. The first factor in mastering
anything is age, and it's not exactly in Luffy's

00:03:39.159 --> 00:03:44.569
factor. People tend to forget that our meat-eating
hero is not even legally allowed to drink

00:03:44.569 --> 00:03:49.040
alcohol in Japan or the US. Well, Germany
is different, there you can start drinking

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:56.739
at 16, where was I? Oh yeah, Luffy is extremely
young, while Doflamingo and Katakuri are 41

00:03:56.739 --> 00:04:04.319
and 48 years old respectively. More than twice
his own age. They had a lot of time to figure

00:04:04.319 --> 00:04:09.709
out there powers and use them on countless
enemies and in many different situations.

00:04:09.709 --> 00:04:16.200
However, we also know that Luffy, just like
Law and probably Kid, have had their devil

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:28.560
fruits from when they were kids, basically
doing nothing but honing their skills. And

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:35.340
they are the leaders of the worst generation
for a reason. All 3 of them, and Luffy especially,

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.530
are fighting prodigies.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:44.090
The next factor is the structure of the story.
IF Luffy should awaken, it's gonna be soon.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:49.650
There is a lot of prophecy around opening
Wano and the man Roger was waiting for. The

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:59.010
year of the prophet, if you want to call it
that, is right now, 20 years later. And even,

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:06.150
though you might say that's not fair as an
argument, that doesn't change the fact that

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:08.140
it's true. Muhhaah.

