00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:31.180
important lessons for unlocking one's Haki
according to Rayleigh, is this: []

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:37.410
So what if the same thing is true for awakening.
Just like advanced Haki can only bloom in

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:43.030
the heat of the hardest battles, awakening
