00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:58.270
And in terms of mastery of his devil fruit?
This was actually really fascinating to think

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:04.310
about. Luffy is a quite special case after
all. He is a paramecia-user, yes, but unlike

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:10.020
Dofi or Magellan who produce their substance,
or Mr 1, who transforms his body into one,

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:17.610
Luffy is 100% made out of Rubber. As we see
in this scene here, he is not doing anything

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:29.720
to turn into it [shanks stretching his arm]
In fact it took Luffy years of training with

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:34.690
Ace and Sabo to get basic control over his
new body before he could even think about

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:40.740
using it for combat. He has to make an active
effort to force his body into shape, which

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:46.060
is basically the same as for Logia users,
the only difference being, that they embody

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:52.750
some sort of energy. Thus the extra category
of special paramecia, that borders very close

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:58.830
to logia. So the fact that luffy can run around
without randomly stretching all the time is

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:04.240
already a big feat in itself. For example,
when he picks up Usopp on Water Seven, his

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:10.620
arm stretches, but his fingers stay normal,
otherwise that might have ended badly for

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:16.520
Usopp there.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:22.460
In his base form, Luffy uses his muscles to
stretch. In gear second, he expands on this,

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:28.210
by using his rubber body to pump blood and
increase his power and speed. Pumping your

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:33.870
own blood faster seems like pretty fantastic
control over his fruit to me. Gear third is

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:39.370
the same, using the rubber properties of his
bones to expand his entire body, stretching

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:47.430
and then forcing it into a gigantic shape.
And with gear forth it gets really interesting,

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:53.150
because here he uses the internal expansion
of his third gear, but limits it with his

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:58.190
haki, compressing his body, which allows him
to use the properties of this hardened rubber.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:03.450
Thus his moments are so fast that the air
has no time to go anywhere, allowing him to

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:18.030
fly, while he can even charge up his punches,
releasing them with even more power and speed.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:24.150
Imagine taking a really hard and thick spring
and compressing it flat, before unleashing

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:30.331
it. That's Luffy's entire body in gear fourth.
So, while he does use Haki as a crutch here,

00:08:30.331 --> 00:08:36.379
he is able to control his powers even more
harshly and precisely with this technique.

00:08:36.379 --> 00:08:42.009
The Point I'm trying to make here, is that
Luffy has already taken his Rubber Body to

00:08:42.009 --> 00:08:47.560
the extreme. Could you creatively come up
with some complete different use of his power?

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:53.860
Probably, but the way he masters his body
and uses is freely is pretty pretty masterful

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:59.930
in books at least. So, I would argue that
Luffy has actually already been ready for

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:05.370
his awakening during the time skip, similar
to kid and law. I think the only difference

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:11.689
here, is that Luffy was not aware that Devil
Fruit Awakening was even a think until Doflamingo

00:09:11.689 --> 00:09:19.009
told him about it, but maybe even more importantly,
he has been fully focused on Haki. Rayleigh

00:09:19.009 --> 00:09:26.029
has no Devil Fruit. He was a pure Haki mentor
for Luffy, because without advanced Haki you

00:09:26.029 --> 00:09:41.579
can't even touch the big guns 
in the new world. And so, I'm pretty sure

00:09:41.579 --> 00:09:47.199
that Luffy's Awakening will come to him preeety
swiftly, should he ever feel like his Haki

00:09:47.199 --> 00:09:48.690
had reached its limits.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:53.689
So let's say it happens in the fight against
Kaido, who might have his own awakening, or

00:09:53.689 --> 00:10:00.730
even a bit later: But what will Luffy's awakening
actually look like? For Logia users, we suspect,

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:05.610
that they can turn the matter around them
into their respective element, for zoan fruits

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:18.730
it means a larger monster-like version of
themselves that has increased stats across

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:27.690
the board. But since Luffy doesn't do us the
