Gear 5 really was connected to awakening,

00:11:19.589 --> 00:11:23.230
I think it would mostly make sense for an
internal one.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:29.550
The first idea here is basically Luffy being
able to go into overdrive. With his awakening,

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:34.949
Luffy gains complete control over his body.
He is now freely able to mix and switch between

00:11:34.949 --> 00:11:40.790
