a bit of a waste for such an important update,

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.680
so I rate it 4/10.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:18.579
The next internal awakening theory is vulcanisation.
And that doesn't only sound cool, it is. Vulcanisation

00:12:18.579 --> 00:12:26.569
