and fire way better. Similar to overdrive,

00:12:44.399 --> 00:12:48.980
Luffy would get a boost to all his stats,
but most importantly, it might allow him to

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:54.839
form shapes with his body and harden them.
So Luff&nbsp;could actually form weapons and shapes

00:12:54.839 --> 00:13:00.170
with his body, similar to mr. 1. I think this
idea is more niche than the last, but I like

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.129
